1
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:07,695
Now I've taken weakness as my ally

2
00:00:07,696 --> 00:00:11,347
I can fly to the highest heights

3
00:00:11,347 --> 00:00:14,130
If I would just stop here

4
00:00:14,130 --> 00:00:18,782
all I've lost would lose its luster

5
00:00:18,782 --> 00:00:22,304
If you were lost out somewhere

6
00:00:22,304 --> 00:00:25,912
at the same time my heart is shaken

7
00:00:25,913 --> 00:00:28,782
Id have no way to find you

8
00:00:28,782 --> 00:00:32,826
your kindness, or even your strength

9
00:00:32,826 --> 00:00:38,521
I know

10
00:00:38,521 --> 00:00:40,391
It's time for the dawn!

11
00:00:40,478 --> 00:00:43,782
My peak performance

12
00:00:43,869 --> 00:00:47,826
blow straight past in a blast, yeah

13
00:00:47,826 --> 00:00:50,608
You'll be left frozen with laughs

14
00:00:50,608 --> 00:00:55,043
The days of pain left in the past, let's hope

15
00:00:55,043 --> 00:00:57,869
As Imake foes of the world

16
00:00:57,869 --> 00:01:02,304
Em bracing myself upon shaking legs, yeah I'm

17
00:01:02,304 --> 00:01:05,043
Just keep me going for a few more steps

18
00:01:05,043 --> 00:01:09,912
Now, this is the comeback, the time to awaken is now

19
00:01:19,521 --> 00:01:24,478
Now, this is the comeback, the time to awaken is now

20
00:01:35,913 --> 00:01:37,348
So Nika...

21
00:01:39,521 --> 00:01:42,043
...has finally emerged.

22
00:01:43,130 --> 00:01:46,434
I can scarcely believe
two Emperors of the Sea fell at the same time...

23
00:01:52,130 --> 00:01:54,304
We cannot suppress
knowledge of these events.

24
00:01:54,304 --> 00:01:57,260
The news will spread
around the world almost instantly.

25
00:01:57,260 --> 00:01:59,999
The timing could not be any worse!

26
00:02:00,478 --> 00:02:01,956
How do we approach this?

27
00:02:03,304 --> 00:02:04,564
With respect to Zou...

28
00:02:12,608 --> 00:02:15,738
Is it true that Zou disappeared?

29
00:02:16,130 --> 00:02:19,695
Yes...
Gradually, into the fog.

30
00:02:20,217 --> 00:02:22,956
But what could that mean...?

31
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,913
That they will not open the borders!

32
00:02:27,913 --> 00:02:31,826
The Land of Wano remains
an impregnable fortress!

33
00:02:31,826 --> 00:02:35,304
Perhaps they have adapted
their strategies to the situation.

34
00:02:35,869 --> 00:02:37,956
They appear to be under
capable leadership.

35
00:02:39,260 --> 00:02:43,651
Then overrunning the country
through force of numbers is impossible.

36
00:02:46,869 --> 00:02:49,347
Is retrieving Nico Robin...

37
00:02:49,347 --> 00:02:51,869
...still within your ability?

38
00:02:51,869 --> 00:02:52,652
Absolutely!

39
00:02:57,130 --> 00:02:59,608
CP-0! CP-

40
00:03:01,521 --> 00:03:03,260
A jamming signal?

41
00:03:05,304 --> 00:03:06,782
You guys...

42
00:03:09,086 --> 00:03:11,347
Identify yourself!

43
00:03:13,260 --> 00:03:14,999
Stay right where you are!

44
00:03:16,652 --> 00:03:19,869
I'm comin' to you!

45
00:03:26,565 --> 00:03:30,782
The Land of Wano,
freed from twenty years of tyranny,

46
00:03:30,782 --> 00:03:33,434
celebrates the victory of the Kozuki Clan!

47
00:03:46,217 --> 00:03:47,739
Drake...

48
00:03:47,739 --> 00:03:48,782
Are you...

49
00:03:49,565 --> 00:03:51,478
...a marine?

50
00:03:52,521 --> 00:03:53,999
You expect me to answer?

51
00:03:55,826 --> 00:03:57,347
You came here to ask me that?

52
00:04:01,957 --> 00:04:04,348
You look like you've been
to hell and back...

53
00:04:10,043 --> 00:04:13,347
I thought you predicted you'd be safe...

54
00:04:13,696 --> 00:04:16,565
...as long as you didn't betray Kaido...

55
00:04:21,696 --> 00:04:22,652
I...

56
00:04:23,565 --> 00:04:26,738
When I saw that beast before me,
I knew I was a dead man walking,

57
00:04:26,739 --> 00:04:29,435
and so I became Kaido's subordinate.

58
00:04:30,174 --> 00:04:32,174
Kid and Killer, on the other hand,

59
00:04:34,217 --> 00:04:36,174
continued to resist...

60
00:04:38,608 --> 00:04:41,565
...despite certain death!

61
00:04:45,739 --> 00:04:50,652
Even if I had foreseen their victory...

62
00:04:52,608 --> 00:04:55,391
How could I...

63
00:04:56,130 --> 00:04:59,826
How could I ever return to Kid after all this time,
tail between my legs?

64
00:05:10,957 --> 00:05:12,652
So you weren't talking about me...?

65
00:05:13,086 --> 00:05:14,999
That one-percent thing?

66
00:05:19,391 --> 00:05:22,087
Then the fortune you told
for a "certain man" was...

67
00:05:30,086 --> 00:05:31,260
...mine.

68
00:05:47,869 --> 00:05:50,086
So hungry...

69
00:05:50,086 --> 00:05:54,782
Nay, I am not!
Samurai do not want for food!

70
00:05:54,869 --> 00:05:56,043
Hey, folks!

71
00:05:56,043 --> 00:05:59,043
Don't take down the Fire Festival
decorations just yet!

72
00:05:59,043 --> 00:06:02,086
By declaration of Momonosuke-sama+
er, our Lord, the Shogun,

73
00:06:02,086 --> 00:06:04,216
we are to hold another festival!

74
00:06:04,217 --> 00:06:05,608
Aye!

75
00:06:05,608 --> 00:06:06,565
Yay!

76
00:06:08,435 --> 00:06:12,304
Starting today,
I'll be teaching this class.

77
00:06:12,304 --> 00:06:14,825
Is Miss Sarahebi gone?!

78
00:06:14,826 --> 00:06:15,956
Whyzzat?

79
00:06:17,826 --> 00:06:21,652
Sorry, but you'll all need to forget
everything she's taught you.

80
00:06:22,652 --> 00:06:26,304
I will be re-educating you
on the entire history of our heroes!

81
00:06:26,304 --> 00:06:27,260
Whuuuuuh?!

82
00:06:27,347 --> 00:06:29,043
We dun wanna!

83
00:06:32,347 --> 00:06:35,956
Why don't we start
with a fine fellow, Kozuki Oden?

84
00:06:36,739 --> 00:06:42,826
Shortly after he was born, at the age of zero,
he sent his nanny flying!

85
00:06:46,565 --> 00:06:48,347
Of course, I was surprised!

86
00:06:48,347 --> 00:06:53,869
Komurasaki-sama, the most beautiful woman
in all of Wano, is Oden-sama's daughter!

87
00:06:54,435 --> 00:06:59,347
And it was the Kawamatsu the Kappa
that saved her from the burning castle!

88
00:06:59,347 --> 00:07:02,260
What a beautiful story of loyalty!

89
00:07:02,260 --> 00:07:08,434
The samurai that protected her by disguising himself as
a chivalrous criminal named Kyoshiro...

90
00:07:08,435 --> 00:07:12,565
...was none other than one of the
Nine Red Scabbards, Denjiro-dono!

91
00:07:14,521 --> 00:07:17,565
Do you know who took down Kaido?

92
00:07:17,565 --> 00:07:20,825
I do! Heard it was a warrior
by the name of Joyboy!

93
00:07:20,826 --> 00:07:23,565
Seems like he's
already left the country.

94
00:07:23,565 --> 00:07:27,869
wish I could have seen him!
He's a hero rivaled only by the God of the Blade!

95
00:07:41,521 --> 00:07:43,260
Build temples?

96
00:07:43,565 --> 00:07:44,651
Mm-hmm.

97
00:07:44,652 --> 00:07:46,739
As was done for Ryuma,
the God of the Blade,

98
00:07:46,739 --> 00:07:50,478
I want to build one dedicated to Oden-sama
upon a hill overlooking the Flower Capital!

99
00:07:51,608 --> 00:07:53,260
Surrounding that,

100
00:07:53,260 --> 00:07:57,695
we will build temples dedicated to Yasuie-dono
and the other Daimyo that fought for our country.

101
00:07:59,304 --> 00:08:00,608
And...

102
00:08:06,565 --> 00:08:09,043
...for Ashura and Izo as well...

103
00:08:26,174 --> 00:08:27,652
Onimaru!

104
00:08:31,391 --> 00:08:34,130
Onimaru, that tickles!

105
00:08:34,130 --> 00:08:36,043
To think you were alive!

106
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:40,043
Ah, this brings back memories...

107
00:08:40,043 --> 00:08:43,260
You, too, are a brother-in-arms,
having fought for our country.

108
00:08:43,782 --> 00:08:48,217
I suppose we, too, shall someday be
laid to rest alongside Ashura and Izo.

109
00:08:49,913 --> 00:08:52,565
If that is fine with you, Marco-dono?

110
00:08:53,304 --> 00:08:54,912
Of course, yes sirree.

111
00:08:56,739 --> 00:08:59,130
One's home soil is best.

112
00:08:59,130 --> 00:09:01,695
That's probably what Izo'd want.

113
00:09:06,608 --> 00:09:09,565
There I go, surviving again...

114
00:09:12,260 --> 00:09:14,564
As did we...

115
00:09:15,957 --> 00:09:20,478
Had we lived through it all,
only for something to befall our heroes...

116
00:09:22,304 --> 00:09:23,782
I could not bear the thought.

117
00:09:24,826 --> 00:09:26,391
Let us pray they are well.

118
00:09:28,608 --> 00:09:30,521
So hungry...

119
00:09:30,521 --> 00:09:33,391
Nay, nay, nay...

120
00:09:35,696 --> 00:09:36,826
Oh, dear brother!

121
00:09:36,826 --> 00:09:38,391
My dear brother!

122
00:09:39,478 --> 00:09:41,261
Yamato-kun, where are you?!

123
00:09:41,782 --> 00:09:44,260
Luffytaro-san and Zorojuro-san have...!

124
00:09:46,652 --> 00:09:50,478
Oh, dear brother!
Luffytaro-san and Zorojuro-san have...

125
00:09:54,130 --> 00:09:56,608
...awakened!

126
00:10:02,260 --> 00:10:04,521
Ever the tomboy...

127
00:10:04,913 --> 00:10:06,869
It does not hurt though...

128
00:10:06,869 --> 00:10:09,434
Boooooze!

129
00:10:09,435 --> 00:10:12,521
Meeeeat!

130
00:10:14,957 --> 00:10:17,869
Luffy! Zoro!
You have awakened!

131
00:10:17,869 --> 00:10:20,739
Luffy! You are awake!

132
00:10:20,739 --> 00:10:24,565
Good morning, Luffy!
Thank goodness you did wake up!

133
00:10:24,565 --> 00:10:26,912
It's way too soon for you
to be drinking that much!

134
00:10:28,782 --> 00:10:31,608
Whew, this's somethin' to celebrate!

135
00:10:31,608 --> 00:10:34,434
How about we
get this party started?!

136
00:10:34,435 --> 00:10:38,478
Come, now, you two!
Do not eat too much yet!

137
00:10:38,478 --> 00:10:44,086
The whole country was going to
have a grand feast when you woke up!

138
00:10:44,086 --> 00:10:45,347
Let us have it today!

139
00:10:55,347 --> 00:10:57,390
'Tis I, Momonosuke!

140
00:10:57,391 --> 00:10:59,304
Mo-mo-no-suke!

141
00:11:00,565 --> 00:11:02,478
Hwuuuuh?!

142
00:11:02,478 --> 00:11:05,304
Oh, I get it!
You're all grown up now!

143
00:11:05,304 --> 00:11:07,738
Your body's lookin' pretty strong!

144
00:11:07,739 --> 00:11:09,261
Because of Oden's blood, huh?

145
00:11:10,304 --> 00:11:11,564
Lemme try punchin' ya.

146
00:11:11,608 --> 00:11:12,434
Do not!

147
00:11:12,913 --> 00:11:14,957
O-Nami!

148
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:17,522
They are bullying me!

149
00:11:19,347 --> 00:11:22,086
O-Nami, save me!

150
00:11:25,608 --> 00:11:26,869
Knock that off!

151
00:11:30,043 --> 00:11:33,695
I-I am still eight years old!

152
00:11:34,478 --> 00:11:36,086
It does not hurt though...

153
00:11:36,086 --> 00:11:37,477
Oh, that's right.

154
00:11:37,478 --> 00:11:40,348
He's as tough as I thought...

155
00:11:42,521 --> 00:11:45,651
This is the adult world, Momo!

156
00:11:45,739 --> 00:11:48,478
You cannot hide behind
the privilege of youth anymore!

157
00:11:51,435 --> 00:11:52,826
Here!

158
00:11:53,260 --> 00:11:56,695
Child on the inside,
Oden on the outside!

159
00:11:56,696 --> 00:11:58,956
Stop putting a tray on my head
every time you see me!

160
00:12:01,347 --> 00:12:04,521
Such a sturdy body!
You have your parents to thank for that!

161
00:12:04,521 --> 00:12:08,825
You will most definitely be
the greatest samurai in our country!

162
00:12:08,826 --> 00:12:10,391
And I shall persevere at that!

163
00:12:13,739 --> 00:12:15,130
Mealtime, mealtime!

164
00:12:23,957 --> 00:12:25,608
Oh yeah, Yamato!

165
00:12:25,608 --> 00:12:29,738
Let's hit the baths before the feast!
Your prayers were answered, right?

166
00:12:31,043 --> 00:12:32,173
"Prayers"?

167
00:12:33,174 --> 00:12:37,043
I heard there's a custom in Wano
where one abstains from doing something...

168
00:12:37,043 --> 00:12:40,825
...until one's wish comes true,
as a form of prayer to the gods.

169
00:12:40,826 --> 00:12:43,782
Until you two recovered,

170
00:12:44,826 --> 00:12:47,130
I gave up eating and bathing!

171
00:12:47,130 --> 00:12:49,956
Oh, really!!

172
00:12:49,957 --> 00:12:53,130
Thank you, Yamabro!
I'm all better, thanks to you!

173
00:12:53,130 --> 00:12:55,130
Whattaguy, eh?

174
00:12:56,130 --> 00:12:59,260
Neither of us is dirty, though...

175
00:12:59,260 --> 00:13:02,260
I wiped your bodies clean!

176
00:13:02,608 --> 00:13:04,130
Does it please you?

177
00:13:07,347 --> 00:13:09,738
Mossbrain!
Let's talk...

178
00:13:11,304 --> 00:13:13,477
Oh yeah, you...

179
00:13:14,565 --> 00:13:16,130
But after the battle,

180
00:13:16,869 --> 00:13:19,826
if I've lost my mind...

181
00:13:20,608 --> 00:13:22,825
you gotta kill me.

182
00:13:24,086 --> 00:13:26,260
That's right, I...

183
00:13:28,043 --> 00:13:32,390
I came back
from hell to kill you!

184
00:13:33,217 --> 00:13:35,130
Uh, yeah, no,
I'm good now.

185
00:13:35,826 --> 00:13:37,173
It's all good now...

186
00:13:38,217 --> 00:13:41,304
You can't be sane
with that dumb-lookin' face!

187
00:13:41,347 --> 00:13:44,825
What'd you say, asswipe?!
look totally sane, no matter how ya slice it!

188
00:13:44,826 --> 00:13:46,608
Die with honor, dammit!

189
00:13:46,608 --> 00:13:48,478
How 'bout you die, Mossbrain?!

190
00:13:48,478 --> 00:13:50,260
You told me to kill you!

191
00:13:50,260 --> 00:13:51,782
Sheesh...

192
00:13:51,782 --> 00:13:53,956
Well, let's go take a bath, then!

193
00:13:53,957 --> 00:13:57,347
Oh, Nami.
There's no mixed bath in the castle.

194
00:13:57,347 --> 00:14:01,260
Might I... accompany you, Nami-san?

195
00:14:01,260 --> 00:14:02,347
Hmm?

196
00:14:10,391 --> 00:14:12,913
All right, bathtime!

197
00:14:12,913 --> 00:14:14,260
Yeah!

198
00:14:14,260 --> 00:14:16,608
Ya-hoo!

199
00:14:23,739 --> 00:14:25,826
Baths rock!

200
00:14:25,826 --> 00:14:28,695
What?! A dream?!

201
00:14:30,826 --> 00:14:33,260
Y-Yamato! You...

202
00:14:35,086 --> 00:14:36,477
Ah, so refreshing!

203
00:14:36,478 --> 00:14:39,608
Being in the bath together
is the best!

204
00:14:39,608 --> 00:14:42,173
We're gonna party after this!

205
00:14:42,174 --> 00:14:44,043
It's gonna be great!

206
00:14:47,782 --> 00:14:50,043
The men's bath is so noisy!

207
00:14:51,826 --> 00:14:55,869
I wanna be bewitchin' just like you!

208
00:14:56,826 --> 00:14:57,782
Feels good!

209
00:14:57,782 --> 00:15:02,999
Remember how we all used to bathe together
with Oden-sama and your family?

210
00:15:03,391 --> 00:15:06,782
Though it was quite uncomfortable for me
to bathe with other men...

211
00:15:06,782 --> 00:15:09,173
O-Kiku-chan
you have not changed one bit!

212
00:15:09,174 --> 00:15:11,304
And now, I am older than you!

213
00:15:12,739 --> 00:15:14,521
Feels good!

214
00:15:14,521 --> 00:15:17,347
Shooo goood!

215
00:15:17,347 --> 00:15:20,260
Hey, did you hear?!
They said the feast is today!

216
00:15:20,260 --> 00:15:24,086
&Let's have another celebration!
To the revival of the Kozuki Clan!

217
00:15:24,086 --> 00:15:26,782
Let all the regions know!

218
00:15:33,304 --> 00:15:35,347
Managed to get 'er back
to her old self!

219
00:15:35,347 --> 00:15:37,869
Yeah, she's looking seaworthy!

220
00:15:38,478 --> 00:15:41,608
General Franky's all fixed up, too!

221
00:15:42,826 --> 00:15:45,086
It's just so cool!

222
00:15:46,478 --> 00:15:49,000
No fraternizin', you morons!

223
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:52,739
Don't let your guard down
'til we've left port safely!

224
00:15:55,652 --> 00:16:00,478
Information must have leaked from somewhere
and reached journalists by now.

225
00:16:00,957 --> 00:16:05,608
And we're gonna be pegged as
replacement Emperors of the Sea!

226
00:16:05,608 --> 00:16:10,478
He's right. This is an isolated country,
so people can't look in from the outside,

227
00:16:10,478 --> 00:16:13,000
but we can't see
our enemies' movements, either.

228
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:18,522
Maybe our captains' bounties have shot up to
something crazy! Like, higher than any we've seen!

229
00:16:20,869 --> 00:16:25,956
Got that right! Couldn't tell ya
how the info leaked, but...

230
00:16:25,957 --> 00:16:27,217
Apoo!

231
00:16:27,217 --> 00:16:31,391
You're the source, gotta be!
You really piss me off, you know that?!

232
00:16:33,478 --> 00:16:36,608
Those bounties you were talkin' about?
got 'em, right here!

233
00:16:38,652 --> 00:16:39,956
Wanna see 'em?

234
00:16:42,521 --> 00:16:44,391
They're all there!

235
00:16:44,391 --> 00:16:46,782
Your new bounties, and...

236
00:16:46,782 --> 00:16:52,260
...the names of the
soon-to-be-crowned Emperors of the Sea!

237
00:16:56,174 --> 00:16:58,956
I told you to tell me
where the hell you are now!

238
00:16:59,304 --> 00:17:03,521
And I told you, Sakazuki-san,
I'm in the air!

239
00:17:04,565 --> 00:17:06,695
In the air where?!

240
00:17:06,696 --> 00:17:09,956
Oh, I can see Wano now.

241
00:17:11,217 --> 00:17:14,434
You will not do anything stupid!

242
00:17:14,435 --> 00:17:16,913
Got that, Green Bull?!

243
00:17:20,478 --> 00:17:22,304
Understood!

244
00:17:22,869 --> 00:17:24,434
Imean it.

245
00:17:50,869 --> 00:17:53,608
"Time's up"

246
00:17:54,826 --> 00:17:58,348
Someone said again, with a laugh

247
00:17:58,869 --> 00:18:03,347
Fine then, hide-and-seek playtime...

248
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:05,000
...is over

249
00:18:06,782 --> 00:18:10,217
Let's go, come on (We can see it soon)

250
00:18:10,260 --> 00:18:14,043
Let your heart beat out

251
00:18:15,043 --> 00:18:18,303
and things will change (We can see it soon)

252
00:18:18,565 --> 00:18:22,608
Grow strong, you have time

253
00:18:22,696 --> 00:18:23,479
Lift up that dream

254
00:18:23,739 --> 00:18:30,478
The overflowing loneliness can't sustain me alone

255
00:18:30,696 --> 00:18:34,609
We were so free in our younger days

256
00:18:34,739 --> 00:18:38,000
What a dumb dream

